{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Quantum Tanks&quot; combines 3D, top-down shooting, and classic tank battle gameplay. Use agile maneuvering to defeat all enemy tanks and clear the levels.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique shell interception mechanic: You can fire shells to detonate enemy shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a tank's shell is detonated at close range, it will also deal damage to the tank itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven carefully designed maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No health pickups in the maps\u2014only various types of cover. The satisfaction of defeating powerful enemies is a key highlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All enemies are equipped with high-level AI systems. They automatically seek your position and fire shells at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you start a level, enemy tanks will patrol in different patterns, providing a fresh experience every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Game Controls \u2014 &quot;W, S&quot; control the forward and backward movement of the tank, &quot;A, D&quot; control the rotation of the tank, hold the left mouse button to control the firing position, and release it to fire the shell.</u></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537720?t=1741338927","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537720?t=1741338927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537720/1dc07b98a1db7ad13b1ff8fd60a885db01029ae1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741338927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537720/1dc07b98a1db7ad13b1ff8fd60a885db01029ae1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741338927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Quantum Tanks&quot; combines 3D, top-down shooting, and classic tank battle gameplay. Use agile maneuvering to defeat all enemy tanks and clear the levels.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique shell interception mechanic: You can fire shells to detonate enemy shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a tank's shell is detonated at close range, it will also deal damage to the tank itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven carefully designed maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No health pickups in the maps\u2014only various types of cover. The satisfaction of defeating powerful enemies is a key highlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All enemies are equipped with high-level AI systems. They automatically seek your position and fire shells at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you start a level, enemy tanks will patrol in different patterns, providing a fresh experience every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Game Controls \u2014 &quot;W, S&quot; control the forward and backward movement of the tank, &quot;A, D&quot; control the rotation of the tank, hold the left mouse button to control the firing position, and release it to fire the shell.</u></i></p>","developers":["\u591c\u884c\u8005"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps